{
  "version": "1.0",
  "title": "《Sequence 3: Plan 規劃篇》全單元大綱與逐字稿",
  "total_duration_seconds": 433.83,
  "total_scenes": 5,
  "total_shots": 61,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "sc3.1_01",
      "scene_num": "3.1",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 3.1 Shot 01",
      "text": "所謂Plan，就是規劃，那規劃什麼呢？規劃出一個你認為能夠提昇品質的方案！",
      "duration": 7.85,
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 7.85,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.1_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.1_02",
      "scene_num": "3.1",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 3.1 Shot 02",
      "text": "因此，這個步驟的工作項目將包括：觀察與記錄、界定目標範圍、分析原因、設計對策。",
      "duration": 8.33,
      "start_seconds": 7.85,
      "end_seconds": 16.18,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.1_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_01",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 01",
      "text": "戴明認為，組織是一個由人和機器所組成的系統。",
      "duration": 4.8,
      "start_seconds": 16.18,
      "end_seconds": 20.98,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_02",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 02",
      "text": "那這個系統會持續地產出我們所需要的產品或服務，但是在運行過程中，也難免會出現品質不良的情形。",
      "duration": 8.5,
      "start_seconds": 20.98,
      "end_seconds": 29.48,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_03",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 3,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 03",
      "text": "這些品質不良事件，可能只是偶然發生，也可能會反覆出現。",
      "duration": 5.59,
      "start_seconds": 29.48,
      "end_seconds": 35.07,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_04",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 4,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 04",
      "text": "所以，你如果想提高品質，就是讓這些不良事件消失，或者把它發生的頻率降到最低。",
      "duration": 7.75,
      "start_seconds": 35.07,
      "end_seconds": 42.82,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_05",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 5,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 05",
      "text": "而為了要消除這些不良事件，我們就必須先知道，究竟有哪些不良事件！",
      "duration": 6.17,
      "start_seconds": 42.82,
      "end_seconds": 48.99,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_06",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 6,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 06",
      "text": "因此，在規劃步驟的第一個工作，就是要持續地觀察系統，並把所有的不良事件都記錄下來，",
      "duration": 7.85,
      "start_seconds": 48.99,
      "end_seconds": 56.84,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_07",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 7,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 07",
      "text": "記載事項要包括發生的時間，地點、所造成的影響等等。",
      "duration": 5.64,
      "start_seconds": 56.84,
      "end_seconds": 62.48,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_08",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 8,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 08",
      "text": "留下這些紀錄之後，才可以讓我們在將來做出正確的分析，並設計出有效的對策。",
      "duration": 6.77,
      "start_seconds": 62.48,
      "end_seconds": 69.25,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_09",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 9,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 09",
      "text": "舉例而言，如果台鐵想要改善火車誤點問題，首先要做的，就是把所有誤點事件都記錄下來，",
      "duration": 7.94,
      "start_seconds": 69.25,
      "end_seconds": 77.19,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.2_10",
      "scene_num": "3.2",
      "shot_idx": 10,
      "title": "Scene 3.2 Shot 10",
      "text": "內容可能要包括每次誤點的車次、時間、地點、載客人數等。以協助後續的分析與設計。",
      "duration": 9.14,
      "start_seconds": 77.19,
      "end_seconds": 86.33,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.2_line_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_01",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 01",
      "text": "當你對系統做完「觀察與記錄」之後，接著就要「界定目標範圍」。",
      "duration": 5.54,
      "start_seconds": 86.33,
      "end_seconds": 91.87,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_02",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 02",
      "text": "也就是說，要找出系統中，問題最嚴重的某些項目，當作你的改善目標，才能夠以最低的成本，獲得最高的成效！",
      "duration": 9.43,
      "start_seconds": 91.87,
      "end_seconds": 101.3,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_03",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 3,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 03",
      "text": "這時候，建議你要參考「80/20」定律，意思是：80%的不良事件，是由20%的項目所造成的。",
      "duration": 9.5,
      "start_seconds": 101.3,
      "end_seconds": 110.8,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_04",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 4,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 04",
      "text": "所以，你如果能找到這關鍵的20%項目，加以解決，就可以獲得80%的效益！",
      "duration": 7.82,
      "start_seconds": 110.8,
      "end_seconds": 118.62,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_05",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 5,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 05",
      "text": "以火車誤點事件為例，",
      "duration": 2.78,
      "start_seconds": 118.62,
      "end_seconds": 121.4,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_06",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 6,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 06",
      "text": "如果以「地點」為分類，以「誤點次數」當作影響指標，會發現，ABC三個地點所累計的誤點次數，",
      "duration": 8.09,
      "start_seconds": 121.4,
      "end_seconds": 129.49,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_07",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 7,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 07",
      "text": "就佔了所有誤點次數的81%了。",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "start_seconds": 129.49,
      "end_seconds": 133.23,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_08",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 8,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 08",
      "text": "如果改以「時段」做分類，以「載客人數」當作影響指標，會發現，HG二個時段所累計的載客人數，",
      "duration": 7.94,
      "start_seconds": 133.23,
      "end_seconds": 141.17,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_09",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 9,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 09",
      "text": "就佔了所有載客人數的78%了",
      "duration": 3.82,
      "start_seconds": 141.17,
      "end_seconds": 144.99,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_10",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 10,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 10",
      "text": "當然，不良事件的「分類方式」以及「影響指標」的選擇，都是你可以自行變換調整的，",
      "duration": 7.06,
      "start_seconds": 144.99,
      "end_seconds": 152.05,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.3_11",
      "scene_num": "3.3",
      "shot_idx": 11,
      "title": "Scene 3.3 Shot 11",
      "text": "就看你怎麼樣運用你的洞察力，找到「項目最少，影響力最大」的關鍵項目囉。",
      "duration": 6.36,
      "start_seconds": 152.05,
      "end_seconds": 158.41,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.3_line_11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_01",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 01",
      "text": "一旦你選定了特定的範圍，接著就要把範圍內的所有不良事件都撈出來，分析他们的原因。",
      "duration": 7.15,
      "start_seconds": 158.41,
      "end_seconds": 165.56,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_02",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 02",
      "text": "注意，每個不良事件都要分析喔！因為，不良事件的外表雖然都很相似，但他们的起因往往是不同。",
      "duration": 9.5,
      "start_seconds": 165.56,
      "end_seconds": 175.06,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_03",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 3,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 03",
      "text": "同樣是火車誤點，某一次可能是單純的「高壓電線斷裂」所造成，另一次可能是複雜的營運管理問題所造成。",
      "duration": 8.5,
      "start_seconds": 175.06,
      "end_seconds": 183.56,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_04",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 4,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 04",
      "text": "不過，不良事件這麼多，要全部分析太花時間啦。所以，你必須要學會「抓大放小」，才能獲得最高效益。",
      "duration": 10.25,
      "start_seconds": 183.56,
      "end_seconds": 193.81,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_05",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 5,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 05",
      "text": "要怎麼抓大放小呢？",
      "duration": 2.3,
      "start_seconds": 193.81,
      "end_seconds": 196.11,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_06",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 6,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 06",
      "text": "戴明建議我們，先把所有的不良事件，根據他们發生的時間以及影響程度，畫出一份「控制圖」。",
      "duration": 8.23,
      "start_seconds": 196.11,
      "end_seconds": 204.34,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_07",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 7,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 07",
      "text": "然後再根據他们的落點，分成兩大類。",
      "duration": 4.08,
      "start_seconds": 204.34,
      "end_seconds": 208.42,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_08",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 8,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 08",
      "text": "第一類稱為「特殊事件」，也就是那些零零星星，散落在區間外的不良事件。",
      "duration": 6.5,
      "start_seconds": 208.42,
      "end_seconds": 214.92,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_09",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 9,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 09",
      "text": "第二類則稱為「常態事件」，也就是那些數量龐大，聚集在區間內的事件。",
      "duration": 6.38,
      "start_seconds": 214.92,
      "end_seconds": 221.3,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_10",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 10,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 10",
      "text": "當你的資源有限時，應該優先處理「特殊事件」，而把「常態事件」留到以後再處理。",
      "duration": 6.94,
      "start_seconds": 221.3,
      "end_seconds": 228.24,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_11",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 11,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 11",
      "text": "為什麼呢？因為，特殊事件的數量通常很少，危害卻很大，而且，因果關係比較清楚，容易診斷。",
      "duration": 9.89,
      "start_seconds": 228.24,
      "end_seconds": 238.13,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_12",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 12,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 12",
      "text": "畢竟，每個特殊事件都可以找到一個對應的「特殊原因」來解釋，你只要消滅這個原因，",
      "duration": 7.06,
      "start_seconds": 238.13,
      "end_seconds": 245.19,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_13",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 13,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 13",
      "text": "特殊事件就不會再發生了，問題也就解決了。所以，你應該優先處理特殊事件。",
      "duration": 8.33,
      "start_seconds": 245.19,
      "end_seconds": 253.52,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_14",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 14,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 14",
      "text": "例如，某些誤點是由「高壓電線斷裂、駕駛員疏忽、平交道車禍」所造成的，這就是特殊事件，應該要優先處理。",
      "duration": 9.62,
      "start_seconds": 253.52,
      "end_seconds": 263.14,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_15",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 15,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 15",
      "text": "至於「常態事件」啊，通常數量龐大，為害卻不明顯，而且，往往也找不到明確的原因來解釋。",
      "duration": 8.16,
      "start_seconds": 263.14,
      "end_seconds": 271.3,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_16",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 16,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 16",
      "text": "以台鐵誤點問題為例，最常見的，就是那些慢個三分鐘，五分鐘的誤點，你很難指出是那個原因要負責，",
      "duration": 8.81,
      "start_seconds": 271.3,
      "end_seconds": 280.11,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_17",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 17,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 17",
      "text": "只能說是「整體環境所造成」。你真要檢討，",
      "duration": 5.64,
      "start_seconds": 280.11,
      "end_seconds": 285.75,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_18",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 18,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 18",
      "text": "可能可以講成是「時刻表設計不良+月台動線規劃不當+票務系統有問題+駕駛員訓練不足",
      "duration": 7.61,
      "start_seconds": 285.75,
      "end_seconds": 293.36,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_19",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 19,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 19",
      "text": "+維修調度不配合...」是這些「共業」一起造成的。",
      "duration": 4.37,
      "start_seconds": 293.36,
      "end_seconds": 297.73,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_20",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 20,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 20",
      "text": "要想解決這類誤點啊，就非常麻煩，必須提昇整體營運系統，才有可能，所以我們通常先不處理。",
      "duration": 8.33,
      "start_seconds": 297.73,
      "end_seconds": 306.06,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_21",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 21,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 21",
      "text": "列出所有的「特殊事件」之後啊，接著就要一一分析出每個特殊事件的原因。",
      "duration": 6.0,
      "start_seconds": 306.06,
      "end_seconds": 312.06,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_22",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 22,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 22",
      "text": "那分析的時候，建議你可以採用心智圖法，靠著自由聯想來擴大思考空間。",
      "duration": 6.58,
      "start_seconds": 312.06,
      "end_seconds": 318.64,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_23",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 23,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 23",
      "text": "或者採用腦力激盪法，透過小組會議來擴大靈感來源。",
      "duration": 5.21,
      "start_seconds": 318.64,
      "end_seconds": 323.85,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_24",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 24,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 24",
      "text": "那最常用的，則是「魚骨圖法」，讓你可以進行地毯式搜索，將各種面向的原因都一網打盡。",
      "duration": 7.75,
      "start_seconds": 323.85,
      "end_seconds": 331.6,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_24.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_25",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 25,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 25",
      "text": "舉例而言，台鐵為了找出特殊事件的誤點原因，可以針對每次誤點，都透過魚骨圖法，",
      "duration": 7.15,
      "start_seconds": 331.6,
      "end_seconds": 338.75,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_25.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_26",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 26,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 26",
      "text": "從「個人、流程、設備、管理、環境、材料」六個面向，執行全方位的地毯式探索，就一定可以找到原因。",
      "duration": 9.94,
      "start_seconds": 338.75,
      "end_seconds": 348.69,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_26.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.4_27",
      "scene_num": "3.4",
      "shot_idx": 27,
      "title": "Scene 3.4 Shot 27",
      "text": "不過要注意，每個特殊事件，都要執行一次，才可以把所有的誤點原因，都一網打盡。",
      "duration": 7.66,
      "start_seconds": 348.69,
      "end_seconds": 356.35,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.4_line_27.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_01",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 01",
      "text": "找到原因之後，接著就要設計對策。建議你可以採用反魚骨圖法，針對每個原因，設計一套對策。",
      "duration": 9.41,
      "start_seconds": 356.35,
      "end_seconds": 365.76,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_02",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 02",
      "text": "剛剛有提到。「特殊事件」的對策很簡單，只要想辦法把對應的「特殊原因」消滅就好了。",
      "duration": 7.66,
      "start_seconds": 365.76,
      "end_seconds": 373.42,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_03",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 3,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 03",
      "text": "舉例而言，「高壓電線斷裂」就是一個特殊原因，消滅這個原因的對策可以是：改用更好的材質、做好保養工作、",
      "duration": 9.14,
      "start_seconds": 373.42,
      "end_seconds": 382.56,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_04",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 4,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 04",
      "text": "平衡電力負載...等。那「平交道車禍」則是另一個特殊原因，消滅這個原因的對策可能是「檢修交通號誌、",
      "duration": 8.98,
      "start_seconds": 382.56,
      "end_seconds": 391.54,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_05",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 5,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 05",
      "text": "加強護欄設備、鐵路地下化」等",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "start_seconds": 391.54,
      "end_seconds": 395.28,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_06",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 6,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 06",
      "text": "「常態事件」的對策就比較複雜了，因為他必須要能夠「提昇整體的營運效能」，",
      "duration": 6.29,
      "start_seconds": 395.28,
      "end_seconds": 401.57,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_07",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 7,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 07",
      "text": "所以內容通常是一整組的配套方案，",
      "duration": 3.7,
      "start_seconds": 401.57,
      "end_seconds": 405.27,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_08",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 8,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 08",
      "text": "項目可能包括「調整時刻表+調整月台動線+調整票務系統+調整訓練課程+調整調度方式...」，",
      "duration": 7.99,
      "start_seconds": 405.27,
      "end_seconds": 413.26,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_09",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 9,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 09",
      "text": "而且這些項目要一起實施，才有可能改善這類的誤點。",
