      "start_seconds": 413.26,
      "end_seconds": 418.11,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc3.5_line_09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc3.5_10",
      "scene_num": "3.5",
      "shot_idx": 10,
      "title": "Scene 3.5 Shot 10",
      "text": "對策設計完成之後，請以專案管理員的角度，把實施步驟訂定出來，內容應包括：工作項目，工作進度，",
      "duration": 9.24,
      "start_seconds": 418.11,
